1
00:00:00,320 --> 00:00:22,520
Welcome to Renegade Immortal, this donghua is an adaptation of the eponymous web novel written by Er Gen. 
In these subtitles, I will assume the viewer doesn't have any prior knowledge of the genre of cultivation. Please read the attached README and always check for notes at the end of the episodes.
Thank you for watching Bonobosubs, I hope you will enjoy this awesome show !

2
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:33,920
Thousands of years ago,

3
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:33,920
the Heaven Defying Bead, an ancient artifact

4
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:33,920
fell into the cultivation world.

5
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:39,040
The strongest individual in the country of Suzaku, Situ Nan, obtained it.

6
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:43,880
The rumor is that

7
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:43,880
the Heaven Defying Bead is the key to the Ancient Celestial Domain.

8
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:50,680
Since then,

9
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:50,680
the battle for this artifact never stopped.

10
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:55,680
Four Symbols Mountain
Planet Suzaku

11
00:00:57,960 --> 00:01:00,280
Heaven Defying Bead

12
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:01,280
The bead is mine !

13
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:26,790
Situ, the Heaven Defying Bead is not something you can hold.

14
00:01:27,080 --> 00:01:28,190
Shut up.

15
00:01:27,080 --> 00:01:30,120
Situ Nan
Second generation Suzaku
Peak Ascendant

16
00:01:28,720 --> 00:01:31,750
If you can have it

17
00:01:32,040 --> 00:01:33,990
then why can't I ?

18
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,430
How presumptuous...

19
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:17,000
To think I, the strongest individual on planet Suzaku,

20
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:19,320
the second generation Suzaku,

21
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:22,880
would be strong enough to need outsiders to join hands in defeating me.

22
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:25,630
This life was worth it !

23
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:34,150
Hand over the Heaven Defying Bead and I'll spare your life.

24
00:02:34,760 --> 00:02:38,870
And if I... refuse !?

25
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:28,070
Now die !

26
00:03:50,880 --> 00:03:51,910
The Death Finger ?

27
00:04:11,920 --> 00:04:14,240
As time goes on,

28
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:14,910
The Heaven Defying Bead !

29
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:16,200
fate will turn in my favor.

30
00:04:16,520 --> 00:04:19,120
Accept your fate and stay mortal

31
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:21,680
or defy it to become immortal !

32
00:04:48,720 --> 00:05:05,720
Note: This is an ancient confucian text.

33
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:52,600
When the heavens are about bestow a great responsibility on a man,

34
00:04:52,760 --> 00:04:54,640
they first test his resolve,

35
00:04:54,640 --> 00:04:56,280
exhaust his body,

36
00:04:56,320 --> 00:04:57,800
starve him,

37
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:59,600
empty his being,

38
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:01,520
and thwart all his efforts.

39
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:03,440
Wang Lin
Wang Family

40
00:05:01,640 --> 00:05:03,840
Only by cultivating patience and perseverance

41
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:06,920
Wang Lin's house
Wang Family Village

42
00:05:03,840 --> 00:05:05,720
can one overcome everything.

43
00:05:12,280 --> 00:05:14,240
Zhou Yingsu
Wang Lin's mother

44
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:17,840
Wang Tianshui
Wang Lin's father

45
00:05:16,280 --> 00:05:19,880
Note: Tie Zhu is Wang Lin's nickname.

46
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:19,880
Tie Zhu,

47
00:05:19,880 --> 00:05:24,590
the village has to gift wood carvings of Immortals

48
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:27,350
at the Immortal Assembly in 3 days.

49
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:30,960
This is a once-in-three-years opportunity

50
00:05:30,960 --> 00:05:34,400
to influence the protection the Immortals provide to our country of Zhao.

51
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:36,080
They must have

52
00:05:36,080 --> 00:05:38,240
outstanding form and spirit.

53
00:05:40,840 --> 00:05:42,230
Dear, Tie Zhu,

54
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:44,080
lunch is ready.

55
00:05:44,080 --> 00:05:46,080
Okay, you can start without me.

56
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:55,440
Wang Family members

57
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:55,880
You again !

58
00:05:57,000 --> 00:06:01,240
Second Brother, have you been keeping up with the interest this month ?

59
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:02,470
Let's check over there.

60
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:04,630
What kind of junk is this ?

61
00:06:06,280 --> 00:06:07,880
This much is barely acceptable...

62
00:06:09,080 --> 00:06:11,200
We will pay back everything we owe.

63
00:06:11,320 --> 00:06:13,760
But this money was saved up for Tie Zhu's imperial exam.

64
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:14,830
Shut up and move !

65
00:06:14,400 --> 00:06:15,630
It's our family's lifeline,

66
00:06:15,640 --> 00:06:16,310
you can't take it !

67
00:06:16,320 --> 00:06:17,230
Get lost !

68
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:19,150
Debts must be paid.

69
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:21,080
If you can't even repay your family
